Z||000024||mrfixit58||03-13-2001||05:32 PM||||DaRkLoRD says, "I have many friends in the military, and after seeing their behaviour now as opposed to before (joined fresh out of high school) they've changed a lot. their thinking is all oriented around conflict and orders.. and junk about protecting their country's freedom. Honestly, who's gonna take it away?? the USA could crush every other country on the planet..". <P>For the sake of argument, how do YOU suppose made the USA that way?!? Oh wait, I know, because it's shaped funny and we change our leaders ever 4 to 8 years. Ya, that's not it, how about, cause we can build stuff faster and better. Maybe, but who does the work, and who uses those THINGS when they are built. Who flys the planes, steers the ships, tanks, jeeps, trucks? Who shoots the guns, cannons, rockets? Who protects your rights to paint your car purple, buy fancy aluminum wheels or slap a V-8 in it just because you want to. Who protects your right to have your own opinion no matter how STUPID it REALLY IS! <P>Before you go shooting your mouth off about what you would and wouldn't do for this country, make sure you mouth isn't full of McDonald's Big Mac and fries. If this country askes too much, leave! But on your way out, be sure that thank the soldier who's protecting your right to buy a ticket out! And where ever you land, be sure to visit the grave of the soldier who died on that far away land so you have the right to be there!<P>Get real,<BR>Roy  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/mad.gif"><P>||||reg||1
