Z||000026||FieroPerformance||03-13-2001||05:51 PM||||Kids have picked on other kids for years and years, guns have been around for years and years, and I sure that kids have shot at other kids before. There is nothing new about this entire concept. They want publicity, they just sit around and blow their problems out of proportion until they feel it jusitfies shooting someone else. Then they go out and do it. It is getting out of hand, people should be able to joke around and use the word "gun" or "kill" in school without being branded the candy man. When someone is out on the edge and are seriously going to do that do you think they would be jokeing around about it in the hall with all of their friends? Anyway, that is just my opinion. <P>-Charlie<BR>----<BR>jackalrr@cinci.rr.com||||reg||3
